# Chat Application

## Overview

This project is a chat application that uses Node.js and PostgreSQL. Follow these instructions to set up and run the project.

## Prerequisites

1. **Node.js**
   - Download and install [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/).

2. **PostgreSQL**
   - Download and install [PostgreSQL](https://www.postgresql.org/download/).
   - Optionally, use [pgAdmin](https://www.pgadmin.org/download/) for database management.
   - Create database with exactly this name chat_app
  #Configure the Database Connection
   Ensure the following properties are set:
  check the :  .env.development.local
  to set the password of the databaase you have 
  and the port of the db
## Setup Instructions

1. **Clone the Repository**
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/mhmdtfaily/chat-app-backend.git
   cd chat-app-backend
   Install Dependencies
   - npm install
   - npm run migrate:dev
   - npm run seed:dev
   - npm run dev
   
 
  
   
